**Module 8 – Lesson 5: AWS Generative AI Solutions**
Amazon SageMaker JumpStart

Amazon SageMaker JumpStart is a Machine Learning hub inside SageMaker AI that helps developers quickly build, train, and deploy ML models. It provides pre-built ML solutions and pre-trained Foundation Models (FMs) that can be deployed with just a few clicks. These models can also be fine-tuned using your own business data.

Common Use Cases
Rapid ML model deployment
Custom fine-tuned AI solutions
ML experiments and prototypes
Testing different models before choosing one
Benefits
No need to build models from scratch
Faster ML development
Easy deployment
Supports customization using your own data
Amazon Bedrock

Amazon Bedrock is a fully managed Generative AI service designed for working with Foundation Models (FMs). It provides access to powerful models from Amazon and leading AI companies through a single API.
Examples:
Claude
Stable Diffusion
Amazon Titan Models

With Bedrock, you can customize models using your own data and deploy them without managing servers or infrastructure.

Common Use Cases
Enterprise-grade Generative AI applications
Advanced AI chatbots
Text generation
Image generation
Multimodal AI applications (Text + Images)

//Benefits//
Fully managed service
No infrastructure management
Access multiple FMs through one API
Enterprise-level security and privacy
Fast deployment of Generative AI applications

Amazon Q
Amazon Q is an AI-powered assistant that helps employees gain insights, improve productivity, automate tasks, and make decisions faster.
Amazon Q has two major products:
Amazon Q Business
Amazon Q Business connects with company documents, repositories, and business systems.

It can:
Answer employee questions
Extract insights
Automate workflows
Solve business problems
Use Cases
Information requests
Knowledge management
Workflow automation
Business insights
Amazon Q Developer

Amazon Q Developer is designed specifically for software developers.
It helps generate code, review code, detect issues, and improve development speed.
Supported languages:
Python
Java
JavaScript
TypeScript
C#


// MCQ Answers//
Q1:Advertising agency wants text + image generation without managing infrastructure.
✅ Answer: Amazon Bedrock
Reason: Bedrock provides fully managed multimodal Generative AI.

Q2:Software company wants faster coding without sacrificing security and reliability.

✅ Answer: Amazon Q Developer
Reason: Amazon Q Developer generates code, reviews code, and improves developer productivity.
